This package dynamically determines machine dependent constants.  It
writes out the constants in a form suitable for #include files float.h
and limits.h.  The algorithm and code for the floating-point
calculations are from:

    Cody, W. J., "Algorithm 665, MACHAR: A subroutine to dynamically
	determine machine parameters," ACM Transactions on Mathematical
	Software, 14, 303-309, 1988.

"Official" descriptions of the variables are from:

    "Draft Proposed American National Standard for Information
	Systems -- Programming Language C," Doc. No. X3J11/88-001.

